      "id": "dclsnyk",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "8. Upwelling and Downwelling"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Upwelling brings nutrient-rich cold water to the surface.",
      "id": "vn78ng0"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Creates the world’s richest fishing grounds (Peru, Benguela).",
      "id": "6wbrp4t"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Downwelling occurs when surface water sinks.",
      "id": "fe68lk5"
    },
    {
      "id": "uj23887",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Thermohaline Circulation – Global Conveyor Belt"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Driven by density differences caused by temperature and salinity.",
      "id": "zj8u5zn"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Cold, saline water sinks near polar regions.",
      "id": "gn5w2vs"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Deep currents move toward equator.",
      "id": "9eivl4v"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Surface currents complete the cycle.",
      "id": "tys9o0r"
    },
    {
