        "Indian Ocean currents reverse direction seasonally under the influence of monsoon winds.",
        "Cold currents create coastal deserts and cause dense fog when meeting warm currents (e.g., Labrador Current)."
      ],
      "id": "rj7f0o5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Gulf Stream keeps Western Europe warmer than similar latitudes.",
